From 15290c6dd1471a984f0159106651f8a19a58cf5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:08:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] perf(charts): spike an ECharts renderer for the chart
 widget

TimeSeriesEChart draws the time-series widget with ECharts 6.1 on a canvas
(line, bar, grid, tooltip and the canvas renderer only), with colours and
fonts read from the Mantine variables and a redraw when the colour scheme
changes. A resize redraws the canvas without React, so a panel change no
longer costs a 9-chart Recharts layout. The widget's lazy import points at
it in place of TimeSeriesChart.

Spike for review (docs/REVIEW/perf/README.md), not for main as it is.

